                        "entry_id": "2b49e300-21c0-3275-b1ab-9ada68006924",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having a high tendency to melt."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9610fd66-b87c-4a07-951d-76b3443c23ef",
                                "sense_id": "b740c17b-a91e-3326-a022-45a57e76ab51",
                                "text": "This creamy, melty cheese dip is delicious with crisp fresh vegetables."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7eee0933-a402-4a6a-bca5-1e65eaac4831",
                                "sense_id": "b740c17b-a91e-3326-a022-45a57e76ab51",
                                "text": "I must say that the meltiest, most evocative entry in this theme set is BRA OF CHOCOLATE, which, of course, started out as a bar of chocolate until Mr. Berry and the made up “Victoria’s Sweetness catalog” got hold of it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76b64136-6adb-4058-95b9-ff33abcfb509",
                                "sense_id": "b740c17b-a91e-3326-a022-45a57e76ab51",
                                "text": "If you’ve ever eaten Buffalo chicken wings and thought, “These are so good, I just wish they were meltier and cheesier so I could scoop them up with tortilla chips,” here’s Ali’s Buffalo chicken dip."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8cd1b215-cdce-3e58-b80e-b1316cd9f072",
                        "entry_id": "2b49e300-21c0-3275-b1ab-9ada68006924",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In the state of being melted."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb7ea87d-b8ad-4d2a-bca2-d4c122d78903",
                                "sense_id": "8cd1b215-cdce-3e58-b80e-b1316cd9f072",
                                "text": "\"Melt,\" Ms. Martinet directed Ms. Velko, as the young dancer assumed a deep arabesque. \"This is really the meltiest of them all.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "146842ee-090c-4d65-8575-8ed87c9b6ded",
                                "sense_id": "8cd1b215-cdce-3e58-b80e-b1316cd9f072",
                                "text": "Let the cookies cool for about 20 minutes before eating. They’re best when they’re slightly warm and the chocolate chips are still melty. Enjoy!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
